WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
This guy is so rebellious by nature that even the system can’t save him.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,380
Almost

3
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:07,610
But I want to settle on Jinke for his body.

4
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:08,610
what do you like

5
00:00:08,610 --> 00:00:11,610
As the captain, I have to give you something.

6
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:14,020
There's nothing I like about this person

7
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:17,020
The captain of each team really wants to give it away.

8
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:21,590
When I first saw you, it was true

9
00:00:21,590 --> 00:00:23,260
Work for me

10
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:25,260
Drive out all the live pigs

11
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:26,260
Slow down a step

12
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:29,520
I'll dig out your heart and feed it to the pigs

13
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:43,780
A rotten corpse will endanger itself

14
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:44,780
It must be burned in advance

15
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:45,780
I'm clean
